{"product_id":"kamisama-kiss-vol-14","title":"Kamisama Kiss, Vol. 14","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Nanami Momozono is alone and homeless after her dad skips town to evade his gambling debts and the debt collectors kick her out of her apartment. So when a man she's just saved from a dog offers her his home, she jumps at the opportunity. But it turns out his place is a shrine, and Nanami has unwittingly taken over his job as a local deity. Nanami has all kinds of new responsibilities she doesn't understand, dangers she's unaware of, and a cranky ex-familiar who's ... actually pretty hot. What's a new-fledged godling to do?\" \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Julietta Suzuki \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781421555867 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43402699636889,"sku":"5RB9781421555867","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/a69966891e8325d8bc339de2ce957185.jpg?v=1695366396","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/kamisama-kiss-vol-14","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}